*ROUTINE TO READ CARDS OR TAPE INTO A BCD RECORD.                       MDLD0353
*CALLING SEQUENCE-                                                      MDLD0354
*      TSX     CRDBCD,4                                                 MDLD0355
*      HTR     BLOCK,,TAPE                                              MDLD0356
*      HTR     (END OF FILE)                                            MDLD0357
*      HTR     (ERROR)                                                  MDLD0358
*      (NORMAL RETURN)                                                  MDLD0359
*BLOCK IS ADDRESS OF BLOCK WHERE BCD RECORED IS TO BE STORED            MDLD0360
*IF BLOCK IS ZERO RECORD WILL BE STORED IN BCDFST.                      MDLD0361
*TAPE IS ADDRESS TAPE TO BE READ FROM - MUST BE ON CHANNEL A.           MDLD0362
*IF TAPE IS ZERO CARDS WILL BE READ.                                    MDLD0363
*END OF FILE MAY OCCUR FROM CARDS OR TAPE.                              MDLD0364
*ERROR RETURN OCCURS WHEN A NON HOLLERITH CHARACTER IS READ             MDLD0365
*FROM CARDS, BITS 24-35 OF AC SHOW PATTERN OF REJECTED COLUMN.          MDLD0366
